      "text": "(Ejemplo de Network simple)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(Ejemplo de Network simple)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TtYtIK9ylDhmb4O_as1bn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2506.576050582317,
      "y": 1485.8973406576254,
      "width": 904.2833251953125,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 682896017,
      "version": 463,
      "versionNonce": 409990769,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774560987826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Con V = {s,v,t}, s source, t sink, v el transportador\n\nCon E = {sv, vt}\n\nCapacidades Mínimas: \n    c1(sv) = 0\n    c1(vt) = 10\nCapacidades Máximas:\n    c2(sv) = 50\n    c2(vt) = 100",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Con V = {s,v,t}, s source, t sink, v el transportador\n\nCon E = {sv, vt}\n\nCapacidades Mínimas: \n    c1(sv) = 0\n    c1(vt) = 10\nCapacidades Máximas:\n    c2(sv) = 50\n    c2(vt) = 100",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
