      "seed": 778797457,
      "version": 146,
      "versionNonce": 981779135,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774561680139,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Voy a asumir que volvemos a la definición de Network Original, la cuál nos define la red como:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Voy a asumir que volvemos a la definición de Network Original, la cuál nos define la red como:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SpTxy50w1ZxUK2h1uZXGp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1452.42111285586,
      "y": -954.1638384887796,
      "width": 1240.199951171875,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1041804159,
      "version": 553,
      "versionNonce": 1481268657,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774561763347,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dada una Network (V,E,c) y un par de vértices s,t en V, definimos flujo\nde s a t como una función f : E -> ℝ cuyas propiedades son:\n    \n    1) 0 <= f(xy) <= c(xy)      ∀ xy ∈ E.\n    2) inf(x) = outf(x)           ∀xy ∈ V - {s,t}\n    3) outf(s) >= inf(s)\n    4) inf(t) >= outf(t)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dada una Network (V,E,c) y un par de vértices s,t en V, definimos flujo\nde s a t como una función f : E -> ℝ cuyas propiedades son:\n    \n    1) 0 <= f(xy) <= c(xy)      ∀ xy ∈ E.\n    2) inf(x) = outf(x)           ∀xy ∈ V - {s,t}\n    3) outf(s) >= inf(s)\n    4) inf(t) >= outf(t)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QMwexfLQrHp7ig-t5FQF_",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1680.7709276857854,
      "y": -810.7632271959711,
      "width": 39.44548206656282,
      "height": 0.4752467718863045,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
